		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COWARDLY_GG3">
			<Text>Strategic Retreat (Trait)</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COWARDLY_GG3_HELP">
			<Text>This [COLOR_NEGATIVE_TEXT]Unlucky[ENDCOLOR], but Veteran General uses his or her misfortune to improvise on "strategic retreats". Replaces [COLOR_NEGATIVE_TEXT]Despaired[ENDCOLOR].</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COWARDLY">
			<Text>Cowardly</Text>
		</Row>
		<Row Tag="TXT_KEY_PROMOTION_COWARDLY_HELP">
			<Text>-15% [ICON_STRENGTH] Attack/Defense. Unit has a 25% to withdraw when faced with melee attack. Chance of withdrawal decreased against fast enemy units or if there are limited open tiles behind the unit. Acquired when starting the turn near a Great General with the [COLOR_NEGATIVE_TEXT]Cowardly[ENDCOLOR] trait.</Text>
		</Row>
